abstract: >-
  Data, analysis code and figure-reproduction workflows for Recurrent Extinction
  of Resistance Mutations Leads to Convergent Multidrug Resistance in Sequential
  Antibiotic Treatment. Code and its documentation use MIT; study-generated data,
  derived result tables and original figure elements use CC BY 4.0. Third-party
  components retain their existing terms as described in README.md.
